  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nOnce upon a time there was an old mother pig who had one hundred little pigs and not enough food to feed them. So when they were old enough, she sent them out into the world to seek their fortunes. You know the story about the first three little pigs. This is a story about the 92nd little pig.\n\nThe 92nd little pig built a house out of depleted uranium. And the wolf was like, \"dude.\" It was pretty hardcore, but the piggy wasn't playing games. The pig was ready to to have the best house. His brothers and sisters had always come before him and thought they were better than him. The pig was going to have the best house of all. So he worked in a nuclear weapons plant and saved up all of his piggy money to buy the best quality material. \nThe wolf never bothered the 92nd little pig's house.",
